<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1958</h1><p class="ref-lede">1958 in world history: 19 events, 5 births, 11 deaths, 2 works, 5 states founded and 17 that came to an end. 332 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
